    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTivoli Terrace South, Dun Laoghaire.\n\nA charming two-bedroom top floor apartment with panoramic Sea Views to the North and Mountain views to the South.\n\nDNG are delighted to present 7 Bayview Court, a charming two-bedroom apartment in the heart of Dun Laoghaire. Set within an attractive period building just off Tivoli Terrace South, this inviting home combines character, convenience and a highly desirable coastal location.\n\nThe apartment's westerly orientation fills the open-plan living space with afternoon and evening light. An enclosed balcony provides a wonderful vantage point from which to enjoy views towards the Dublin Mountains.\n\nAccommodation\nAn inviting entrance hallway leads to the bright, open-plan kitchen and living area. This comfortable space opens onto the enclosed balcony, creating an appealing setting for everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe accommodation also includes two generous bedrooms and a bathroom. Residents benefit from additional storage in the communal gardens, ideal for bicycles and other larger items, together with one designated parking space.\n\nAn Exceptional Location\n\nBayview Court enjoys an excellent setting within easy walking distance of both Dun Laoghaire and Monkstown town centres. Cafes, shops, restaurants, pubs, schools, churches and other everyday amenities are all close at hand.\n\nDun Laoghaire's picturesque East Pier and waterfront are nearby, offering scenic coastal walks and an outstanding range of recreational amenities. Transport connections are excellent: Dun Laoghaire DART station is a short walk away, while the 46A and 75 bus routes are within easy reach. The N11, M11 and M50 are also readily accessible.\n\nThe surrounding area is home to many of Dublin's finest schools and colleges, making this an attractive opportunity for owner-occupiers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nSpecial Features\n• Charming two-bedroom apartment in a beautiful period property\n• Westerly oriented open-plan kitchen and living space\n• Enclosed balcony with views towards the Dublin Mountains\n• Two generous bedrooms\n• Additional external storage in the communal gardens\n• One parking space plus visitor parking\n• Dun Laoghaire and Monkstown town centres approximately 5-10 minutes' walk away\n• Every conceivable amenity within walking distance\n• Close to Dun Laoghaire's East Pier and waterfront\n• Convenient to the 46A and 75 bus routes and Dun Laoghaire DART station\n• Easy access to the N11, M11 and M50\n• Management fee: EUR 3,000 per annum\n• Management company: Acres Property Management\n\n7 Bayview Court offers period charm, mountain views and exceptional convenience in one of south Dublin's most sought-after coastal locations."
      },
